# rows not projected are not read. Applies on top of MicrobatchPort-1 (its side= argument sits in the same hunk).
# Test: test_microbatch.py --qi-own (every arm: a rank projects index queries on its own rows only, and every output
# bit-identical); mutants qi-rank0-rows (bits) and qi-all-rows (the mechanism check).
